# Public site origin (akademate.com)

`akademate.com` and `www.akademate.com` are the Cloudflare Worker `akademate-web` (OpenNext), account NAZCAMEDIA.

They are not the Hetzner container `akademate-web`. Docker compose on `46.62.222.138` does not update the live marketing site.

## Deploy public marketing (`apps/web`)

```bash
cd apps/web
OPEN_NEXT=1 pnpm cf:deploy
# equivalent: opennextjs-cloudflare build && wrangler deploy --autoconfig=false
```

Pin `next@15.5.14`, `@opennextjs/cloudflare@1.20.2`, `wrangler@4.125.0`. Keep `NEXT_PRIVATE_MINIMAL_MODE=1` in `wrangler.jsonc` or every route 500s (`middleware-manifest.json` dynamic require). Verify `https://akademate.com/en` returns 200 with the new copy before calling it done. A failed Worker deploy needs `wrangler rollback`, not Docker.

Worker: `akademate-web`. Config: `apps/web/wrangler.jsonc`. Verify on `https://akademate.com`.

## Hetzner is tenant/ops only

| Host | Origin |
|------|--------|
| `akademate.com`, `www.akademate.com` | Cloudflare Worker `akademate-web` |
| `cepformacion.akademate.com`, `app.akademate.com` | Hetzner `akademate-tenant` |
| `admin.akademate.com` | Hetzner `akademate-ops` |

Do not `docker buildx` / `compose up akademate-web` to publish the public website.
